sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as MEDITECH
  participant G as HL7 Edge Gateway
  participant Q as Queue (disk)
  participant A as Lab API
  M->>G: ORU^R01 LAB-1001 (MLLP :7890)
  G->>Q: store
  G-->>M: ACK AA
  G->>A: POST /hl7/results (LAB-1001)
  A-->>G: 200
  G->>Q: remove LAB-1001
  Note over A: The lab API goes down
  M->>G: ORU^R01 LAB-1004
  G->>Q: store
  G-->>M: ACK AA (MEDITECH is not held up)
  loop backoff until the API is back
    G->>A: POST /hl7/results (LAB-1004)
    A-->>G: 503
  end
  Note over A: The lab API is back
  G->>A: POST /hl7/results (LAB-1004)
  A-->>G: 200
  G->>Q: remove LAB-1004
  M->>G: ADT^A01 ADT-2001 (MLLP :7891, pass-through)
  G->>A: POST /hl7/admissions
  A-->>G: 200
  G-->>M: ACK AA (the API's answer)
